      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIA ZIPPER (8) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and two placings from nine starts. Missed the frame latest (22.55) when fourth over 400m at Maitland in a NG. Looks well placed and should feature. MAGICAL SAIDE (3) shapes well for this on her brilliant win a few runs back, getting around this track over 324m in 17.43 then hitting the frame in both runs since. Top win three back and can measure up again. STORMS WILL ROLL (2) filled the minor money four on end before breaking through for a deserved win last time, scoring at this track over 324m (17.40). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Can measure up again. SPENCER BANNER (6) is one of the chances after a minor prize from this draw last time.",
